message: >
  Releases are tagged on GitHub; from 0.11.0 on, they are also published on
  PyPI. The main branch may be ahead of the latest release. Please cite the
  release tag you used, or — for an unreleased commit — the commit hash
  itself. The installed package's version metadata does not identify
  unreleased code and should not be cited.
  A persistent identifier will be added to this file when a release is
  archived.
